      "name": "Samuel Helbling",
      "created_at": "2026-02-12T09:22:37.716Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This question concerns the <a href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/c/hr/22\">Frappe HR</a> category and not ERPNext.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>First, create a holiday list: <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/hr/holiday-list#1-how-to-create-a-holiday-list\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Holiday List</a></li>\n<li>Then you can set the holiday list as company default: <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/hr/holiday-list#1-how-to-create-a-holiday-list\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Holiday List</a></li>\n<li>How you assign a holiday list to an employee depends on your Frappe HRMS version.\n<ol>\n<li>Up to version 15, you can assign the holiday list directly via the employee:<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/0/e03576901fa9cf87a8e500a3cff6aa7b9e5ff6d3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e03576901fa9cf87a8e500a3cff6aa7b9e5ff6d3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e03576901fa9cf87a8e500a3cff6aa7b9e5ff6d3_2_689x188.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vZruQRoEB8tauMpfDED3ram0qxd\" width=\"689\" height=\"188\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e03576901fa9cf87a8e500a3cff6aa7b9e5ff6d3_2_689x188.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e03576901fa9cf87a8e500a3cff6aa7b9e5ff6d3_2_1033x282.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e03576901fa9cf87a8e500a3cff6aa7b9e5ff6d3_2_1378x376.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2418×662 57.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></li>\n<li>From version 16 onwards, you assign holiday lists using the doctype “Holiday list assignment”: <a href=\"https://docs.frappe.io/hr/hr/leave-management/holiday-list-assignment\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Holiday List Assignment</a></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>",
